    <item>
      <title>1.3</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:06:49 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[New Side hustles screen: record what you invoice for work on the side, mark each invoice paid or unpaid, and see what to set aside. Models the Portuguese regime simplificado — a coefficient on what you receive, IRS at your marginal rate, IRS Jovem across categories A and B, and the independent-worker contribution exemption while you are also employed.]]></description>
